   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "🔴 FK算出末端 Z=-53mm (末端在基座下方,物理荒谬)\n🔍 URDF字典序是反的、含gripper、漏了shoulder_pan → 读URDF父子链确认正确链序\n🟢 按 base→末端 重建链序 [pan,lift,elbow,wrist_flex,wrist_roll]\n✅ Z 从 -53mm → +268mm (合理)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "🔴 FK算出末端 Z=-53mm (末端在基座下方,物理荒谬)\n🔍 URDF字典序是反的、含gripper、漏了shoulder_pan → 读URDF父子链确认正确链序\n🟢 按 base→末端 重建链序 [pan,lift,elbow,wrist_flex,wrist_roll]\n✅ Z 从 -53mm → +268mm (合理)",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
